tweets.text:
ICE is NOT going to schools to arrest children.

A dangerous illegal alien felon fleeing into a school, or a child sex offender working as an employee, may create a situation where an arrest is made to protect public safety. Criminals are no longer able to hide in America’s schools to avoid arrest.

@POTUS Trump and @Sec_Noem trusts our brave law enforcement to use common sense. We will not tie the hands of law enforcement officers; they must be allowed to PROTECT children from public safety threats.

